---
interface Props {
  title: string
  duration: string
  src: string
  poster: string
  caption: string
}

const { title, duration, src, poster, caption } = Astro.props
---

<figure class="video-card" data-course-video>
  <div class="video-card-heading">
    <span aria-hidden="true">▶</span>
    <strong>{title}</strong>
    <small>{duration}</small>
  </div>
  <video controls playsinline preload="metadata" poster={poster} aria-label={title}>
    <source src={src} type="video/mp4" />
    当前浏览器不支持视频播放，请继续阅读下方的等价文字与公式推导。
  </video>
  <figcaption>{caption} 视频不替代下方文字与公式推导。</figcaption>
</figure>
